'''Surfer Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.3 Update|Version 6.3]] increases health, freeze chance, and has a 100% chance to survive a lethal strike. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.1 Update|Version 10.1]].

