==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Surfer Cat was part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Summer by the Sea (Removed Combo)|Summer by the Sea]].
*The True Form of Surfer Cat and the Marlin's inclusion could be references to Santiago, the protagonist of ''[[wikipedia:The Old Man And The Sea|The Old Man And The Sea]].''
*Castaway Cat could be a reference to the movie "''[[wikipedia:Cast Away|Cast Away]]''".
*Surfer Cat won the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ibeE2VPMXpY 2025 Best Debuffer Nyaward], with a speech accompanying his victory:
<blockquote>
Whoooooa, wicked! A Nyaward! For me? I've just been out vibing in the waves all day and totally spaced that I was even nominated. Y'know, even though us debuffers don't got the muscles of those attackers or defenders, I just wanna say we do our part. If Psycho and me don't step up to those freaky Aliens, or Gardener isn't freezing those gnarly Zombies, the other cats don't get no room to chill to just work their magic, for real! Anyhow the waves are calling... but rest easy, whenever you need me, Surfer Cat's gonna be there!
</blockquote>

